---
// Two RoboCasa365 recordings for the homepage panel: GR00T N1.5 after a scene
// change and Astra after a goal change. Ambient loops; see RecordedVideo.
import RecordedVideo from '../RecordedVideo.astro';
---

<div class="development-recordings">
  <RecordedVideo
    src="/media/robocasa/groot-undo-teleported-croissant.mp4"
    poster="/media/robocasa/groot-undo-teleported-croissant.jpg"
    width={768}
    height={256}
    ambient
    name="GR00T N1.5 recording"
    label="Three camera views of GR00T N1.5 fetching a jam jar, then retrieving a croissant that the simulator moved back to its plate and returning it to the cutting board."
  >
    <strong>GR00T N1.5 · The scene changes.</strong>{' '}
    The simulator puts the placed croissant back on its plate, and the policy
    fetches the jam, then puts the croissant back on the board.
  </RecordedVideo>

  <RecordedVideo
    src="/media/robocasa/astra-goal-change-config3.mp4"
    poster="/media/robocasa/astra-goal-change-config3.jpg"
    width={768}
    height={256}
    ambient
    name="Astra recording"
    label="Three camera views of Astra moving a croissant back onto a blue plate after the instruction changes, then placing a red-lidded jam jar on the cutting board."
  >
    <strong>Astra · The goal changes.</strong>{' '}
    Mid-task, the instruction becomes: return the croissant, but still bring
    the jam.
  </RecordedVideo>
</div>

<style>
  .development-recordings {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 768px;
  }

  .development-recordings :global(.recorded) {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .development-recordings strong {
    color: var(--fg);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 560;
  }
</style>
